WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Of course, you two still can't defeat me.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,760
I still don’t believe it

3
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:08,900
Prepare to start

4
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,880
If it weren't for this opponent

5
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,920
I even thought they were acting

6
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,500
Boss Jin, don’t leave in a hurry

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,460
You still have to apologize to me in Xiao's accent

8
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,380
It was true that I was talking nonsense just now

9
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:30,100
I'm here to sincerely apologize to you. Let's go.

10
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,420
Brother Xiao, are you interested in coaching?

11
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,380
Yes, I’m just not interested in teaching everyone how to exercise.

12
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,980
Give money. How can I give money?

13
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,700
Fixed salary plus commission for each customer

14
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:40,940
Also, if you want to take a personal trainer, you have the money.

15
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,540
I have to work here for sure.

16
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,740
How much does it cost approximately per day?

17
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,580
On average, it's probably a thousand

18
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:47,180
That won't work. I'm not interested.

19
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:49,260
Otherwise, don't work here full time

20
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,500
If you have time, come and sit in front of us

21
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,900
Or help us take private lessons

22
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,260
Just work a few days a month

23
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,980
No way, it's a waste of my time

24
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,580
I still have to carry out buildings to make money.

25
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:58,700
I make two or three thousand a day

26
00:00:58,700 --> 00:00:59,860
Who is playing this with you?
